OL,3,CTupac Shakur: A 30-year wait for
OL,4,Cjustice
OL,6,FTupac Shakur was more than just a
OL,7,Fname, it became a movement.
OL,9,FThe hip-hop icon was equally adored
OL,10,Ffor his flow and his socially
OL,11,Fconscious lyrics ` highlighting
OL,12,Fracism, police brutality and
OL,13,Finequality.
OL,15,FHis life and death have shaped the
OL,16,Fmusic industry and aspects of popular
OL,17,Fculture that few could have predicted
OL,18,Fwhen he was killed in 1996 at the age
OL,19,Fof 25.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/9
