OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786951096
OL,3,CTupac Shakur: A 30-year wait for
OL,4,Cjustice
OL,6,FShakur ` perhaps best known by his
OL,7,Fstage name 2Pac ` was shot during a
OL,8,Fdrive-by in Las Vegas on September 7
OL,9,F1996.
OL,11,FHis killing remains one of the most
OL,12,Fhigh-profile, unsolved murders in
OL,13,FAmerican history.
OL,15,FIt's provided countless theories and
OL,16,Fconspiracies, but no arrests until
OL,17,F2023, when Duane 'Keffe D' Davis was
OL,18,Fsuddenly charged with the star's
OL,19,Fmurder.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786951096
OL,3,CTupac Shakur: A 30-year wait for
OL,4,Cjustice
OL,6,FDavis is 63 years old and a former
OL,7,Fgang member, reportedly a very senior
OL,8,Fone. He is standing trial in Nevada -
OL,9,Fa US state with no statute of
OL,10,Flimitations for murder.
OL,12,FHe is accused of murder with a deadly
OL,13,Fweapon with the intent to promote,
OL,14,Ffurther or assist a criminal gang.
OL,16,FIt's important to note that
OL,17,Fprosecutors aren't saying he pulled
OL,18,Fthe trigger, but rather that he
OL,19,Forchestrated the killing and provided
OL,20,Fthe weapon.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
