PN,31204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786951096
OL,3,CTupac Shakur: A 30-year wait for
OL,4,Cjustice
OL,6,FDavis has pleaded not guilty. If it's
OL,7,Ffound that he is in fact guilty, the
OL,8,Fpunishment could be life in prison
OL,9,Fwithout parole.
OL,11,FThe trial is expected to last about a
OL,12,Fmonth and will undoubtedly dig into
OL,13,Fthe East Coast vs West Coast rap
OL,14,Frivalry.
OL,16,FThis is pretty nuanced and at times
OL,17,Fconvoluted, but in very simple terms
OL,18,Fthe rivalry was represented by two
OL,19,Frecord companies.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
