OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786951096
OL,3,CTupac Shakur: A 30-year wait for
OL,4,Cjustice
OL,6,FOn the West Coast you had Death Row
OL,7,FRecords, which was co-founded by Suge
OL,8,FKnight and had Tupac as a signed
OL,9,Fartist.
OL,11,FOn the East Coast you had Bad Boy
OL,12,FRecords, which was founded by Sean
OL,13,F'Diddy' Combs and had The Notorious
OL,14,FB.I.G. as a signed artist.
OL,16,FLet's go back to the night of the
OL,17,Fshooting... Shakur and Knight had been
OL,18,Fat the Mike Tyson fight at the MGM
OL,19,FGrand hotel.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
