OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786951096
OL,3,CTupac Shakur: A 30-year wait for
OL,4,Cjustice
OL,6,FCCTV footage shows the two of them and
OL,7,Fothers attacking a man named Orlando
OL,8,FAnderson ` an alleged gang member and
OL,9,Fthe nephew of Duane 'Keffe D' Davis.
OL,11,FApproximately three hours later, Tupac
OL,12,Fwas in the passenger seat of Knight's
OL,13,Fcar driving around Las Vegas when a
OL,14,Fwhite car pulls up close and opens
OL,15,Ffire.
OL,17,FThe rapper died six days later in
OL,18,Fhospital, after being shot four times.
OL,19,FKnight survived the attack.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
