PN,31207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786951096
OL,3,CTupac Shakur: A 30-year wait for
OL,4,Cjustice
OL,6,FDuane Davis has in recent years been
OL,7,Foddly vocal in public about his
OL,8,Fconnection to Tupac's death. He shared
OL,9,Fwith police decades ago that he was in
OL,10,Fthe white car in 2008.
OL,12,FHe co-wrote a memoir called 'Compton
OL,13,FStreet Legend' which came out in 2019,
OL,14,Fand explained his motivation behind
OL,15,Fthis admission.
OL,17,F"I sang because they promised I would
OL,18,Fnot be prosecuted," he wrote.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F312A1786951096
OL,3,CTupac Shakur: A 30-year wait for
OL,4,Cjustice
OL,6,FDavid also claimed in the book that he
OL,7,Fwas in the car but added that he also
OL,8,F'tossed' the gun used to kill Shakur
OL,9,Finto the backseat for another gang
OL,10,Fmember to use.
OL,12,FHe and his lawyers are now saying that
OL,13,Fparts of the story were fictionalised
OL,14,Fto make a profit and they shouldn't be
OL,15,Fseen as an admission of guilt.
OL,17,FOpening arguments are due to start on
OL,18,FMonday, August 17.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
